    <briefdescription>
<para>A hardware-accelerated QML item that renders a large list of axis-aligned rectangles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All rectangles are stored as interleaved floats (x1, y1, x2, y2) and uploaded to the GPU as a data texture, making it suitable for tens of thousands of rectangles. Hover detection uses an internal <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SpatialGrid" kindref="compound">SpatialGrid</ref></computeroutput> for O(1) hit tests.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis" kindref="compound">Axis</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
